cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Energiamudel v5: an hourly Baltic day-ahead market model in the browser, with every input traceable to its source"
message: "If you use this model, its results or its data register, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ingerman
    given-names: Andres
abstract: >-
  An hourly day-ahead market model of Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania that runs in the
  browser, with Finland, Sweden SE4 and Poland represented by exogenous hourly price profiles
  and hourly transfer capacities. Built to show what a small modular nuclear plant in Estonia
  and interconnector outages do to Baltic prices, under assumptions the user sets and can see.
  Every input carries a provenance record naming the API call or the document page it came
  from.
keywords:
  - power market model
  - electricity price
  - Baltic
  - Estonia
  - small modular reactor
  - interconnector
  - data provenance
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/andresingerman/energiamudel-baltic"
url: "https://energiamudel.ee"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
